entry.content:
I'd say this is a sort of small update even though it's been 3 months since the last release.

## Changes
* Switched to the [latest unstable](https://github.com/ManualForArchipelago/Manual/releases/tag/manual_unstable_20260815);
* This manual now supports Rulebuilder;
* Shop items are now scoutable;
  * Intended to use once you reach a shop to scout only items in logic, to know which ones are worth buying;

## Bug fixes
* Small typos in requests.csv;
* Certain price categories still displaying rather than being hidden;
  * In particular any shop items costing a non-multiple of 10 dosh;
* Wrong behavior for shop keys when shops are restricted;
  *  Wrong dosh filter for which shop items to *be* in logic leading to more keys than expected being removed while locations remained, making those shops in logic without their expected restriction;
  * Also tried removing the keys *twice*, took away the second removal;

## TODO
Still the same as before:
* [ ] Review requirements for challenges and crafting recipes;
* [ ] Include other types of chests (purple, invisible, master);
* [ ] Include an alternative to challenges or crafting locations in the form of tasks;
  * Similar scope, collect X items or fight X enemies and the like;
* [ ] Add more goal requirements;
* [ ] Add template yamls for different setups, like different game modes;
* [ ] Look into other ways to allow a playthrough from an existing save;
* [ ] Look into other improvements;
